#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Windows {#windows}"
msgstr "Windows {#windows}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "This section provides build instructions for Windows systems.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang seksyong ito ay nagbibigay ng mga tagubilin sa pag-build para sa mga "
"Windows system.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements {#requirements-1}"
msgstr "Mga Kinakailangan {#requirements-1}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Compilation requires the following tools:\n"
"* A Rust compiler: see for example the [guide on installing Qiskit from source](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md#installing-qiskit-from-source)\n"
"* A C compiler: for example, MSVC and the native command prompt offering the ``cl`` command\n"
"* A Python installation, with access to both ``python3.lib`` and ``python3.dll``\n"
"* [`cbindgen`](https://github.com/mozilla/cbindgen): a tool to create the C header, which you can install with `cargo install cbindgen`\n"
"    Note that running the tool from the command line should be enabled, which might require updating your `PATH` variable to include the cargo path.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang compilation ay nangangailangan ng mga sumusunod na tools:\n"
"* Isang Rust compiler: tingnan halimbawa ang [gabay sa pag-install ng Qiskit mula sa source](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md#installing-qiskit-from-source)\n"
"* Isang C compiler: halimbawa, MSVC at ang native command prompt na nag-aalok ng command na ``cl``\n"
"* Isang Python installation, na may access sa parehong ``python3.lib`` at ``python3.dll``\n"
"* [`cbindgen`](https://github.com/mozilla/cbindgen): isang tool para gumawa ng C header, na maaari mong i-install gamit ang `cargo install cbindgen`\n"
"    Tandaan na ang pagpapatakbo ng tool mula sa command line ay dapat na naka-enable, na maaaring mangailangan ng pag-update ng iyong `PATH` variable para isama ang cargo path.\n"

